  "bio": "Welcome to Black Door Tattoo, a bastion of traditional tattoo artistry nestled in the heart of Portland, United States. Our skilled artists, led by the acclaimed Myles Kimball, craft timeless pieces in a creative and inviting environment. As you embrace the ink, elevate the experience by visiting our affiliate, Black Door Barber Co., conveniently located on the second floor. Connect with us at 207 541 5000 or follow our journey on Instagram @myleskimball and @slimeballstudio.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Portland, Maine, United States"
